<title>UK: Bco Bradesco prices $100 mln 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bco Bradesco prices $100 mln 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager J.P. Morgan, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO BRADESCO</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     8.0	 MATURITY    28.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.961    PAY DATE    28.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    99.961    SPREAD	+190 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  30 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
